From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sarun <noreply@sarun>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:25:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make embedded transport portable across Unix hosts

Keep the standalone passthrough daemon Linux-only while exposing the shared filesystem transport on Darwin, including portable vectored I/O, host-independent Statvfs, Linux FUSE errno encoding, and shared event readiness types.

